STEP 2: Select, preview, then explicitly finalize a chess move.
Characters 1-2: enter a piece square (e.g. d2), then Enter.
Every move requires a preview followed by F + Enter.
Other commands: restart, quit, claim, resign
White - enter START square (characters 1-2): ROUTES BEGIN White GOAL c3 d4 LIMIT 2 PASS
NOTE PASS is hypothetical: only White moves, Black passes; not a real sequence of turns
GOAL c3 NOW White 1 Black 0
PIECE N e2 CONDITION ELSE ORDER NONE
PIECE K e1 CONDITION IF MOVES 2 ORDER IF
ROUTE PIECE K e1 e1d2 d2c3 OWN 2 PROTECTORS 1 ATTACKERS 0
SIDE REACH CONDITION IF MOVES 2
SIDE PROTECTED CONDITION IF MOVES 2
ROUTE SIDE PROTECTED e1d2 d2c3 OWN 2 PROTECTORS 1 ATTACKERS 0
ROUTE SIDE PROTECTED e1d2 e2c3 OWN 2 PROTECTORS 1 ATTACKERS 0
GOAL d4 NOW White 1 Black 0
PIECE N e2 CONDITION ELSE ORDER NONE
PIECE K e1 CONDITION ELSE ORDER NONE
SIDE REACH CONDITION IF MOVES 2
SIDE PROTECTED CONDITION ELSE
SQUARE c3 REACH CONDITION IF PROTECTED CONDITION IF
SQUARE d4 REACH CONDITION IF PROTECTED CONDITION ELSE
FIRST-IF REACH c3
FIRST-IF PROTECTED c3
ROUTES END

